0009                  (            scf.d):00053         IT.BSO              RMB       1                   Backspace behavior
0009                  (            scf.d):00054         IT.DLO              RMB       1                   Delete behavior
0009                  (            scf.d):00055         IT.EKO              RMB       1                   Echo flag
0009                  (            scf.d):00056         IT.ALF              RMB       1                   Auto linefeed flag
0009                  (            scf.d):00057         IT.NUL              RMB       1                   End-of-line null count
0009                  (            scf.d):00058         IT.PAU              RMB       1                   Page pause flag
0009                  (            scf.d):00059         IT.PAG              RMB       1                   Number of lines per page
0009                  (            scf.d):00060         IT.BSP              RMB       1                   Backspace character
0009                  (            scf.d):00061         IT.DEL              RMB       1                   Delete-line character
0009                  (            scf.d):00062         IT.EOR              RMB       1                   End-of-record character
0009                  (            scf.d):00063         IT.EOF              RMB       1                   End-of-file character
0009                  (            scf.d):00064         IT.RPR              RMB       1                   Reprint-line character
0009                  (            scf.d):00065         IT.DUP              RMB       1                   Duplicate-last-line character
0009                  (            scf.d):00066         IT.PSC              RMB       1                   Pause character
