0009                  (            scf.d):00071         IT.PAR              RMB       1                   Parity
0009                  (            scf.d):00072         IT.BAU              RMB       1                   Baud rate
0009                  (            scf.d):00073         IT.D2P              RMB       2                   Attached device name string offset
0009                  (            scf.d):00074         IT.XON              RMB       1                   X-ON character
